.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "Version 0.4.1" "OS Assignment"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "../include/myfilefunctions.h"
.br
.B int wordCount(FILE *file, int *lines, int *words, int *chars);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The wordCount function reads a file and counts its lines, words, and characters. It returns 0 when the operation is successful and -1 when invalid arguments are provided.
